Mera 40 lakh ka home loan HDFC me hai (MCLR linked, 9.2%). RLLR (8.6%) me shift karne ka conversion charge 10,000 rupay hai. Ye shift karne par meri total interest saving 15 saal me kitni hogi?

Ek saal pehle job chali gayi thi aur credit card ka 1 lakh ka bill settle kiya tha 40k dekar. Ab salary 1 lakh hai par home loan reject ho raha hai (CIBIL 650). CIBIL repair karke home loan approve karwane ka step-by-step roadmap kya hai?

