Padhai ke liye 20 lakh ka education loan chahiye (US ja raha hu). Collateral nahi hai. NBFCs (13%) bina collateral de rahi hain, jabki PSU Bank (9.5%) collateral maang raha hai. 3 saal baad ki earning project karke NBFC ka ROI justify hota hai?

Mera MSME manufacturing business hai. Turnover 2 Cr hai. Mujhe 50 Lakh ka CC limit (Working Capital) chahiye. Bank DP (Drawing Power) calculate karne ke liye mere stock aur debtors ko margin deduct karke kaise calculate karega? (Numerical example)

