1 Crore ka home loan 30 saal (8.5%) vs 20 saal (8.5%). 30 saal me EMI kam aayegi par interest zyada jayega. Agar main 30 saal ka loan lekar bacha hua paisa Nifty 50 (12% CAGR) me SIP karun, to kya ye arbitrage financially smart hai?

